      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 37 (2 repeats of 18 sts, plus 1 turning chain)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 1 (right side)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dc into the 2nd ch from hook. *Skip 2 ch, work 5 tr into the next ch (peak), skip 2 ch, dc into the next ch, skip 2 ch, dc into the next ch (valley pair), skip 2 ch, work 5 tr into the next ch (peak), skip 2 ch, dc into the next ch*. Repeat for the second chevron. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 3 (counts as first tr). Work 2 tr into the first dc (half peak). *Dc into the centre tr of the next peak, dc into the dc, dc into the next dc (valley), dc into the centre tr of the next peak, work 5 tr into the next dc (peak)*. End with 3 tr into the last dc. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Rows 1 and 2 alternately until the scarf measures 180 cm. Fasten off. Wet block, pinning out the peaks and valleys firmly."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
